# Software Design Document (SDD) Awareness

Before starting any coding or significant analysis, always consult the Software Design Document: [SDD.md](mdc:docs/SDD.md).

This document outlines the application's purpose, functionality, features, and flow. Ensure it is kept up-to-date with any changes made to the application's design or capabilities.

